== Description ==

The '''Furnace''' smelts ore into ingots and reduces raw materials into refined building blocks. It defines 24 raw recipe entries (24 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Bricks]], [[Bullet Shell]], [[Burning]], [[Chrome Buckshot]], [[Chrome Bullet Tip]], [[Chrome Ingot]], [[Cobblestone]], [[Copper Buckshot]], plus 14 more.

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.Furnace</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Furnace</code>.

